WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.400
Simplify, then look at the denominator's primes.

2
00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:08.829
Nine twenty-fourths. Twenty-four has a three in it, but simplify first.

3
00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:14.258
Nine twenty-fourths is three eighths. Eight is all twos, so it stops.

4
00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:19.512
Ten twenty-fourths is five twelfths. A three is left, so it repeats.
